9	 * exactly 10 digits. Mutates the validated {@link OwnerFieldsDto} in place (so {@link BuildOwner}
10	 * stores the normalized value), or throws {@link InvalidTelephoneException} for a 400 when the
11	 * stripped value is not exactly 10 digits.
12	 */
